---
/*
  A real confirmation page, not a hint that disappears after three seconds.
  04-konzept.md section 4.6, "Was nach dem Absenden passiert".
*/
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Application received | Wunder"
  description="Your application reached us. A person reads it and answers within one working day."
  noindex
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
      <h1>We have it.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Three things, so you know what you are waiting for.</p>
      <ol>
        <li>A person reads this, not a filter.</li>
        <li>The person is the one who runs first conversations here.</li>
        <li>You hear back within one working day, whether it is a fit or not.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>
        If you thought of something after sending, reply to the confirmation email rather than
        applying twice.
      </p>
      <p>
        While you wait, <a href="/how-it-works">the three mechanisms</a> are the part worth reading.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
